    "Box (square) breathing: inhale, hold, exhale, hold — each for 4 seconds. A structured rhythm often used for focus and settling under stress. Sit comfortably and keep the counts even." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Box-(Quadrat-)Atmung: ein, halten, aus, halten — je 4 Sekunden. Strukturierter Rhythmus oft für Fokus und Beruhigung unter Stress. Bequem sitzen und Zählzeiten gleich halten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Box (square) breathing: inhale, hold, exhale, hold — each for 4 seconds. A structured rhythm often used for focus and settling under stress. Sit comfortably and keep the counts even."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiración en caja (cuadrada): inhala, mantén, exhala, mantén — 4 segundos cada uno. Ritmo estructurado para foco y calma bajo estrés. Siéntate cómodo y mantén los conteos parejos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiration carrée : inspire, retenez, expire, retenez — 4 secondes chacun. Rythme structuré pour le focus et se poser sous stress. Asseyez-vous confortablement et gardez les comptes égaux."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiro a scatola (quadrato): ispira, trattieni, espira, trattieni — 4 secondi ciascuno. Ritmo strutturato per focus e calming sotto stress. Siediti comodo e tieni i conteggi pari."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oddychanie box (kwadrat): wdech, wstrzymaj, wydech, wstrzymaj — po 4 sekundy. Ustrukturyzowany rytm na fokus i uspokojenie w stresie. Siedź wygodnie i trzymaj równe liczenia."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiração em caixa (quadrada): inspira, segura, expira, segura — 4 segundos cada. Ritmo estruturado para foco e acalmar sob stress. Senta-te confortável e mantém as contagens iguais."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Квадратное дыхание: вдох, задержка, выдох, задержка — по 4 секунды. Структурированный ритм для фокуса и успокоения при стрессе. Сядьте удобно и держите счёт ровным."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "方盒呼吸：吸、屏、呼、屏——各 4 秒。结构清晰，常用于专注与压力下安顿。坐稳，计数保持均匀。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "方盒呼吸：吸、屏、呼、屏——各 4 秒。結構清晰，常用於專注與壓力下安頓。坐穩，計數保持均勻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
