    "Diaphragmatic (belly) breathing: expand the abdomen on the inhale more than the chest, optional short hold, then gently contract on the exhale. Same 4–2–6 timing as deep breathing, with attention on the diaphragm." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwerchfell-/Bauchatmung: beim Einatmen Bauch mehr als Brust weiten, optional kurz halten, beim Ausatmen sanft zusammenziehen. Gleiches 4–2–6-Timing wie tiefes Atmen, Fokus aufs Zwerchfell."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diaphragmatic (belly) breathing: expand the abdomen on the inhale more than the chest, optional short hold, then gently contract on the exhale. Same 4–2–6 timing as deep breathing, with attention on the diaphragm."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiración diafragmática (abdominal): expande el abdomen al inhalar más que el pecho, retención corta opcional, luego contrae suavemente al exhalar. Mismo timing 4–2–6 que la respiración profunda, con atención al diafragma."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiration diaphragmatique (ventrale) : élargissez le ventre à l’inspire plus que la poitrine, courte rétention optionnelle, puis contractez doucement à l’expire. Même timing 4–2–6 que la respiration profonde, attention au diaphragme."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiro diaframmatico (addominale): espandi l’addome in inspirazione più del petto, breve trattenuta opzionale, poi contrai dolcemente in espirazione. Stesso timing 4–2–6 del respiro profondo, attenzione al diaframma."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oddychanie przeponowe (brzuszne): rozszerz brzuch na wdechu bardziej niż klatkę, opcjonalne krótkie wstrzymanie, potem delikatnie ściągnij na wydechu. To samo timing 4–2–6 co głęboki oddech, z uwagą na przeponę."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respiração diafragmática (abdominal): expande o abdómen na inspiração mais do que o peito, retenção curta opcional, depois contrai suavemente na expiração. Mesmo timing 4–2–6 da respiração profunda, com atenção ao diafragma."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Диафрагмальное (брюшное) дыхание: на вдохе расширяйте живот больше груди, опционально короткая задержка, затем мягко сокращайтесь на выдохе. Тот же тайминг 4–2–6, что у глубокого дыхания, внимание на диафрагму."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "膈肌（腹式）呼吸：吸气时腹多于胸扩张，可选短屏，呼气时轻收。与深呼吸相同的 4–2–6，注意力在膈肌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "膈肌（腹式）呼吸：吸氣時腹多於胸擴張，可選短屏，呼氣時輕收。與深呼吸相同的 4–2–6，注意力在膈肌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
