    "Kapalabhati uses rapid, active belly exhales with passive inhales. Timing varies by person — this mode gives you a timer and coaching text only, not a forced metronome. Practice seated, short rounds, rest between." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati nutzt schnelle, aktive Bauchausatmer mit passiven Einatmern. Timing ist individuell — dieser Modus gibt nur Timer und Coaching-Text, kein erzwungenes Metronom. Sitzend üben, kurze Runden, dazwischen pausieren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati uses rapid, active belly exhales with passive inhales. Timing varies by person — this mode gives you a timer and coaching text only, not a forced metronome. Practice seated, short rounds, rest between."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati usa exhalaciones abdominales rápidas y activas con inhalaciones pasivas. El timing varía — este modo solo da temporizador y texto de coaching, no un metrónomo forzado. Practica sentado, rondas cortas, descanso entre ellas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati utilise des expires ventrales rapides et actives avec des inspires passives. Le timing varie — ce mode ne donne qu’un minuteur et un texte de coaching, pas un métronome forcé. Assis, tours courts, repos entre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati usa espirazioni addominali rapide e attive con inspirazioni passive. Il timing varia — questa modalità dà solo timer e testo di coaching, non un metronomo forzato. Pratica seduto, round corti, riposo tra essi."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati używa szybkich, aktywnych wydechów brzusznych z biernymi wdechami. Timing bywa różny — ten tryb daje tylko timer i tekst coachingu, nie wymuszony metronom. Ćwicz siedząc, krótkie rundy, odpoczynek między nimi."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati usa expirações abdominais rápidas e ativas com inspirações passivas. O timing varia — este modo só dá timer e texto de coaching, não um metrónomo forçado. Pratica sentado, rondas curtas, descanso entre elas."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Капалабхати — быстрые активные брюшные выдохи с пассивными вдохами. Тайминг индивидуален — режим даёт только таймер и текст-коучинг, не принудительный метроном. Сидя, короткие раунды, отдых между ними."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati 用快速主动的腹呼，吸气偏被动。个人节奏不同——此模式只给计时与提示文，不做强制节拍。坐姿、短轮次、中间休息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapalabhati 用快速主動的腹呼，吸氣偏被動。個人節奏不同——此模式只給計時與提示文，不做強制節拍。坐姿、短輪次、中間休息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
